    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/46ea506e47eef9a026ee7cf33fcc26d2.poster.avif?t=1732938331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/46ea506e47eef9a026ee7cf33fcc26d2.webm?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/46ea506e47eef9a026ee7cf33fcc26d2.mp4?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A classic platformer</strong><br>Embark on a magical journey as Squirrel Knight on his quest to save the forest. Squirrel Knight is an action-platformer game with upgradable abilities, time trials  and challenging bosses.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/17d5f2ae1ff85dbce50cc1507c238c07.poster.avif?t=1732938331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/17d5f2ae1ff85dbce50cc1507c238c07.webm?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/17d5f2ae1ff85dbce50cc1507c238c07.mp4?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Battle powerful bosses</strong><br>Fight in Boss Rush mode and overcome powered up foes. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/178f74a395ebdf06f27a443a6adc55c4.poster.avif?t=1732938331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/178f74a395ebdf06f27a443a6adc55c4.webm?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/178f74a395ebdf06f27a443a6adc55c4.mp4?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Race against the clock</strong><br>Aim to be the fastest in Time Trial mode.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/ea470a7b55139d60314acc53e4e21f68.poster.avif?t=1732938331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/ea470a7b55139d60314acc53e4e21f68.webm?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/ea470a7b55139d60314acc53e4e21f68.mp4?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Power up your hero</strong><br>Upgrade your abilities by collecting coins and unlocking powerful relics. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/caaa57ad927d0d09e0e39dc7a0ea4fee.poster.avif?t=1732938331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/caaa57ad927d0d09e0e39dc7a0ea4fee.webm?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/caaa57ad927d0d09e0e39dc7a0ea4fee.mp4?t=1732938331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Save the Kingdom!</strong><br>Uncover the mystery of the darkness corrupting the Squirrel Knights, and save the kingdom. <br><br><strong>Community</strong><br>Want to learn more about Squirrel Knight? Join our discord!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828450/extras/cd2eb18802bf7fadd1ab135e0ee35ac0.avif?t=1732938331\" /></div>",
